{
  "_comment": [
    "The resolvd service definition: what peinit starts, and how.",
    "",
    "Identity is Service (the daemon's own virtual account): resolvd needs no privilege at all. Its one",
    "claim on the machine -- binding 127.0.0.53:53 -- is a port reservation",
    "granted to its service SID (resolvd-port.reg), not a capability.",
    "authd attests its distinct virtual account before peinit launches it.",
    "",
    "Readiness is Notify (0): resolvd sends READY=1 once both doors are",
    "open. It does not wait for netd -- localhost and static names answer",
    "with no network, and the netd channel connects when netd is there.",
    "",
    "RuntimeDirectories creates /run/resolvd for the native socket; resolvd",
    "stamps its own descriptor on the socket (Everyone may connect; the",
    "control object decides what they may do).",
    "",
    "RestartPolicy is Always (2): a machine without its resolver cannot name",
    "anything, and a restart costs only the cache.",
    "",
    "Shipped by the resolvd package into /usr/share/regim/; inert until an",
    "image names it in [registry] autoapply."
  ],
  "keys": [
    { "path": "Machine\\System" },
    { "path": "Machine\\System\\Services" },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Services\\resolvd",
      "values": [
        { "name": "ImagePath", "type": "sz", "data": "/usr/sbin/resolvd" },
        { "name": "Triggers", "type": "multi", "data": ["boot"] },
        { "name": "Identity", "type": "sz", "data": "Service" },
        { "name": "Readiness", "type": "dword", "data": 0 },
        { "name": "RuntimeDirectories", "type": "multi", "data": ["resolvd"] },
        { "name": "RestartPolicy", "type": "dword", "data": 2 },
        { "name": "ErrorControl", "type": "dword", "data": 0 },
        { "name": "DisplayName", "type": "sz", "data": "Stub resolver" },
        { "name": "Description", "type": "sz", "data": "Name resolution for every program: the native socket, the stub listener on 127.0.0.53, and the hosts NSS shim behind them" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
